**Read:** [Inventory Analytics — Roberto Rossi](../sources/Inventory-Analytics-Rossi.lingua#r_61Y17EAC05XZSS1B28NX17SV7C), the entire book, exercises and computational methods; [Warehouse & Distribution Science — Bartholdi and Hackman](../sources/Warehouse-and-Distribution-Science.lingua#r_1QVYHWFDZJB0PMG6V9CB2M4H10), the complete published book and applicable projects; [Graduate Logistics Systems — MIT ESD.260J](../sources/Graduate-Logistics-Systems-MIT.lingua#r_4NMCCS7JPNK6CD9V9Z4XTQPKR8), the entire public graduate programme; [Graduate Supply Chain Planning — MIT 15.762J](../sources/Graduate-Supply-Chain-Planning-MIT.lingua#r_16MZ0PJM4KC10A3D9AYYESBT6P), the entire public graduate programme; [Enterprise-wide Optimization: A New Frontier in Process Systems Engineering — Grossmann](../sources/Enterprise-wide-Optimization-Grossmann.lingua#r_4XD1X5QN83H40RBMGJVSZY9Y8V), the whole paper and chosen primary references; [Supply chain management for the process industry — Songsong Liu](../sources/Process-Industry-Supply-Chain-Management-Liu.lingua#r_5W74Q34MKEJAWVS30JV4QH01YQ), the whole thesis, deriving the selected methods; [Fundamentals of Supply Chain Theory — Snyder and Shen](../sources/Fundamentals-of-Supply-Chain-Theory-Snyder-Shen.lingua#r_4MFFYSAE67RQNHCV2AAQ1X0GXJ), the whole authorized second edition as an optional deeper mathematical route.

Finish Rossi's entire Inventory Analytics and the whole published Warehouse & Distribution Science, deriving their models and solving substantial exercises with an independent comparison. Read the Portuguese introductions in full where useful. Work the complete public MIT graduate Logistics Systems and Supply Chain Planning progressions with their actual notes, assignments and readings. Identify missing campus/commercial material explicitly; the public syllabus is not evidence of having completed it. Snyder and Shen supplies an optional authorized whole-book mathematical extension.

For chemical depth, read complete product manuals and the entire applicable WHO, storage, transport and association guides. Read the EFS book in full for a cross-family storage/transfer investigation. Reconstruct the complete EPA disruption report, guide and chosen profiles. Keep the existing industrial-chemistry manufacturing books/courses available for the transformations being used.

Then work Grossmann's complete perspective, the full relevant primary model papers and Liu's entire doctoral thesis, deriving and independently reproducing a selected formulation/result. Compare modelling assumptions, alternative objectives, evidence and computational limits rather than treating a thesis title as proof of the present argument.

The following studies offer several ways to deepen this one subject. Follow the ones needed for the question, then integrate the learning into a complete defended system and independent research. Demonstrated physical work, public-case reconstruction, supplied-data analysis and synthetic-model studies must describe their actual scope. A literature study can be substantial and rigorous while leaving material qualification or operational performance unverified.

